# mxcli widget init writes the same 43 widget docs to two places:
#   Generated 43 widget docs in .ai-context/skills/widgets
#   Generated 43 widget docs in .claude/skills/widgets
# They are byte-identical (FINDINGS 142). .ai-context/ is the one this project's
# CLAUDE.md points at and the one that is committed; ignoring the copy keeps the
# same files from landing in the repo twice. `mxcli widget init` recreates it.
.claude/skills/
